@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@administratorJwt = replace-with-your-session-jwt
@serviceKey = replace-with-the-once-revealed-key
@serviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@boardId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@version = 1

### List service identities
GET {{baseUrl}}/service-users
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorJwt}}

### Create an independent identity
POST {{baseUrl}}/service-users
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Content assistant"}

### Read the created resource at its Location
GET {{baseUrl}}/service-users/{{serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorJwt}}

### Read its own access
GET {{baseUrl}}/service-users/{{serviceId}}/access
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorJwt}}

### Set access using role ids returned by the access endpoint
PUT {{baseUrl}}/service-users/{{serviceId}}/access
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roleIds":["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"],"grants":[],"restrictions":[]}

### Disable at the observed version
PUT {{baseUrl}}/service-users/{{serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{version}},"enabled":false}

### Rotate the key
POST {{baseUrl}}/service-users/{{serviceId}}/rotate
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{version}}}

### Soft delete
POST {{baseUrl}}/service-users/{{serviceId}}/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{version}}}

### Restore as developer
POST {{baseUrl}}/service-users/{{serviceId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorJwt}}

### Permanently delete as developer
POST {{baseUrl}}/service-users/{{serviceId}}/hard/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorJwt}}

### MCP initialize
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceKey}}
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-11-25","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"Example agent","version":"1.0"}}}

### MCP initialized notification: 202
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceKey}}
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"notifications/initialized"}

### MCP tool discovery
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceKey}}
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/list"}

### Discover enabled module tools, such as forum_get_posts and forum_post_posts
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceKey}}
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":6,"method":"tools/list"}

### Query published forum posts with a typed query object
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceKey}}
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":7,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"forum_get_posts","arguments":{"query":{"boardId":"{{boardId}}","page":1}}}}

### Create a forum topic through the JSON request body
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceKey}}
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":8,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"forum_post_posts","arguments":{"body":{"boardId":"{{boardId}}","title":"MCP example topic","body":"Created through the authenticated forum module tool."}}}}

### Read published news under this service user's own permissions
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceKey}}
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"api_request","arguments":{"method":"GET","path":"/news","query":{"page":"1"}}}}

### Discover application JSON API request shapes
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceKey}}
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2025-11-25

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"api_schema"}}

### Server streams are unsupported: 405 when enabled and authenticated
GET {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceKey}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### Transport sessions are unsupported: 405
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceKey}}

### Missing credentials: 401 when enabled
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"method":"ping"}
